{"code":"PP05","wikidata":"Q16307495","wikipedia":{"en":"Bang Rak Yai MRT station","th":"สถานีบางรักใหญ่"},"summary":{"en":"Bang  Rak Yai station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Purple Line. The station opened on 6 August 2016 and is located on Rattanathibet road in Nonthaburi Province. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีบางรักใหญ่ เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายฉลองรัชธรรม ตั้งอยู่บนถนนรัตนาธิเบศร์ระหว่างทางแยกบางพลูกับทางแยกต่างระดับบางรักน้อย อำเภอบางบัวทอง จังหวัดนนทบุรี"},"opened":"2016-08-06","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/201701_Bang_Rak_Yai_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Bang_Rak_Yai_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Bang_Rak_Yai_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Bang_Rak_Yai_Station_20230709-1.jpg/960px-Bang_Rak_Yai_Station_20230709-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bang_Rak_Yai_Station_20230709-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Bang_Rak_Yai_Station_20230709-2.jpg/960px-Bang_Rak_Yai_Station_20230709-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bang_Rak_Yai_Station_20230709-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"exits":[],"unlabeledExits":0,"elevators":0,"busStops":3,"nearby":[]}
